      "help_en": "The application ID.\n\nOn the Application Monitoring > Application List page in the Application Real-Time Monitoring Service (ARMS) console, click the target application name. The URL in the browser address bar contains the PID of the application in the format of pid=xxx. Because the browser encodes the URL, you must modify the PID. For example, if the PID in the URL is xxx%4074xxx, replace %40 with @. The PID is then xxx@74xxx",
